{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/md83q1gj","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":168,"width":585.6,"height":292.8},"name":"testing-scope-body","text":"AI response parsing: extract plain, fenced and embedded JSON, then validate the required fields.\nAction safety: enforce the allowlist and reject unknown or shell-like actions before execution.\nData and metrics: check project, requirement, test-case and result persistence, plus empty and mixed pass-rate calculations.\nExecution and reporting: validate UI/API outcomes, record failures and evidence, and generate project reports.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":17.33,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#001233","alignment":"left"}}
